await google.colab.output.renderOutput(dataTable, element);\n","        const docLink = document.createElement('div');\n","        docLink.innerHTML = docLinkHtml;\n","        element.appendChild(docLink);\n","      }\n","    </script>\n","  </div>\n","\n","\n","    </div>\n","  </div>\n"],"application/vnd.google.colaboratory.intrinsic+json":{"type":"dataframe","repr_error":"Out of range float values are not JSON compliant: nan"}},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","[doc_007] 07_會員集點優惠與常見 QA (0.6991)\n","本文件彙整門市現行優惠活動、環保杯折扣規定以及顧客最常詢問的常見問題。\n","\n","1. 環保杯自帶杯優惠\n","- 折扣金額：顧客自備環保杯購買任一飲品，每杯現折 **5 元**。\n","- 容量提醒：門市大杯（L）容量為 660ml（鮮奶類為 500ml～600ml），若顧客自備環保杯容量小於飲品容量，會將多餘飲品另外裝杯或依比例調整，點單前需先與顧客確認杯子容量。\n","\n","2. 品牌會員制度與點數兌換\n","- 加入方式：掃描門市櫃台 QR Code 加入官方 LINE 帳號並綁定手機號碼即可免費成為會員。\n","- 集點規則：單筆消費每滿 35 元可累積 1 點（外送平台訂單不參與集點）。\n","- 點數兌換：\n","  * 集滿 5 點：可免費兌換任選加料一份（珍珠、綠茶凍、仙草凍等）。\n","  * 集滿 10 點：可折抵任一飲品 30 元。\n","  * 集滿 15 點：可免費兌換 65 元以下指定飲品一杯。\n","- 生日禮遇：會員生日當月 1 號，系統自動發送一張「全品項任選一杯 8 折優惠券」，限當月使用完畢。\n","\n","3. 顧客常見問題 QA\n","- Q1：請問有提供外送服務嗎？滿多少錢可以外送？\n","  * A：有的！門市 2 公里內消費滿 200 元即可享免費外送；2 至 4 公里內消費滿 400 元可外送（實際依各門市商圈距離為準，建議提前 30 分鐘來電預訂）。\n","- Q2：你們的珍珠是素食的嗎？素食者可以喝哪些飲料？\n","  * A：店內的白玉珍珠、綠茶凍、仙草凍、小芋圓與黑糖粉粿皆為「純植物性原料製作（不含明膠與動物性成分）」，奶素者可安心飲用全系列鮮奶飲品；全素者（不喝牛奶）則可安心飲用所有純茶、果茶與配料。\n","- Q3：請問可以使用哪些支付方式？\n","  * A：門市支援現金、LINE Pay、街口支付、Apple Pay、悠遊卡以及信用卡感應支付。\n","- Q4：大甲芋頭鮮奶可以做成熱的嗎？\n","  * A：可以的！大甲芋頭鮮奶提供「溫飲（約 55°C）」，但因為鮮奶加熱過高會破壞營養並產生奶皮，因此鮮奶類飲品最高皆製作為「溫飲」，不提供滾燙熱飲喔！\n","來源： 未提供\n","\n","[doc_001] 01_品牌理念與核心價值 (0.6661)\n","1. 品牌起源與堅持\n","「牧夏茶飲（Milksha Craft Tea）」創立於台灣台南，初衷是希望打造一杯「連自己孩子都能安心天天喝」的健康手搖飲。我們堅持不使用奶精粉、化學香精或人工色素，所有鮮奶系列飲品皆採用台灣在地契作牧場直送的 100% 純鮮乳，搭配每日新鮮現煮的台灣原葉茶湯，呈現最純粹的自然茶香與乳香。\n","\n","2. 三大品質承諾\n","- 鮮乳承諾：嚴選榮獲國家級品質認證的在地牧場鮮乳，絕不添加任何奶粉還原或植物性奶油，保留最濃郁滑順的天然乳脂香氣。\n","- 原葉承諾：拒絕使用碎茶末與茶精，精選南投名間、鹿谷及花蓮瑞穗等地的優質原葉茶，每桶茶湯超過 4 小時未售完即刻倒掉重煮，確保茶湯不苦澀。\n","- 手作承諾：店內珍珠、芋泥、仙草凍與果醬皆堅持每日門市新鮮現煮或由中央廚房低溫冷鏈配送，不添加防腐劑。\n","\n","3. 門市服務精神\n","我們相信手搖飲不只是解渴的飲料，更是傳遞日常溫暖的媒介。每位夥伴在接待顧客時，都應保持微笑、主動詢問飲品偏好，並在遞交飲料時給予真誠的祝福。\n","來源： 未提供\n","\n","[doc_005] 05_季節限定與果茶系列 (0.6602)\n","果茶系列均採用台灣在地鮮榨果汁或手工熬煮果醬，清爽酸甜，適合不喝奶類或喜歡果香的顧客。\n","\n","1. 【季節限定】巨峰葡萄初戀冰茶（咖啡因：輕）\n","- 供應期間：每年 7 月至 11 月限定販售。\n","- 主要原料：彰化大村新鮮巨峰葡萄果肉與原汁、原鄉四季青茶、綠茶凍。\n","- 黃金比例：微糖（3分糖）、微冰（建議做冷飲，不提供熱飲）。\n","- 風味描述：嚴選甜度高達 18 度的彰化巨峰葡萄，手工剝皮去籽熬煮，搭配清香青茶與滑嫩綠茶凍，酸甜多汁，每一口都能吸到飽滿果肉，帶來如初戀般的酸甜好心情。\n","\n","2. 【季節限定】愛文芒果冰沙（無咖啡因）\n","- 供應期間：每年 5 月至 9 月限定販售。\n","- 主要原料：屏東枋山與台南玉井愛文芒果果肉、100% 牧場鮮乳（少量提味）、綠茶凍。\n","- 黃金比例：甜度冰塊固定（冰沙製程無法調整）。\n","- 風味描述：使用大量新鮮愛文芒果現打成綿密冰沙，果香極度濃郁，底層鋪上清爽綠茶凍增加口感，是盛夏消暑的最高人氣王。\n","\n","3. 柳丁綠茶（咖啡因：輕）\n","- 主要原料：雲林古坑鮮榨柳丁原汁、茉莉綠茶。\n","- 黃金比例：微糖（3分糖）、微冰。\n","- 風味描述：100% 新鮮柳丁原汁搭配淡雅茉莉綠茶，入口充滿陽光般的柑橘果香，維生素 C 滿滿，飯後飲用最解膩。\n","\n","4. 檸檬霸（無咖啡因）\n","- 主要原料：屏東九如整顆新鮮綠檸檬連皮現榨、純蔗糖。\n","- 黃金比例：半糖（5分糖，因整顆檸檬皮精油較酸澀，建議半糖風味最佳）、少冰。\n","- 風味描述：連同檸檬皮一起鮮榨，完整保留檸檬皮的天然精油香氣，酸勁十足、清涼醒腦，是疲勞或想提神時的最佳選擇（不建議點無糖，會過於酸澀）。\n","\n","5. 蜂蜜檸檬晶凍（無咖啡因）\n","- 主要原料：台灣龍眼花蜜、屏東九如鮮榨檸檬汁、手作愛玉晶凍。\n","- 黃金比例：甜度固定（純蜂蜜調味）、微冰。\n","- 風味描述：溫潤香甜的龍眼蜜完美修飾了新鮮檸檬的酸度，加上滑溜溜的愛玉晶凍，零咖啡因且清爽零負擔。\n","來源： 未提供\n"]}],"source":["# QUESTION = \"我晚上喝茶會睡不著，而且有乳糖不耐症，有什麼可以喝？\"\n","TOP_K = 3\n","results = search_documents(QUESTION, TOP_K)\n","display(pd.DataFrame([\n","    {\"排名\": r[\"rank\"], \"doc_id\": r[\"doc_id\"], \"標題\": r[\"metadata\"][\"title\"],\n","     \"cosine_similarity\": r[\"score\"], \"來源\": r[\"metadata\"][\"source_url\"]}\n","    for r in results\n","]))\n","for result in results:\n","    print(f\"\\n[{result['doc_id']}] {result['metadata']['title']} ({result['score']:.4f})\")\n","    print(result[\"text\"])\n","    print(\"來源：\", result[\"metadata\"][\"source_url\"] or \"未提供\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"7611b770","metadata":{"id":"7611b770"},"source":["## 14. 保存索引、文件、編號對照與設定\n","\n","第二份 Colab 需要下面四個檔案，不能只拿 FAISS 索引：\n","\n","| 檔案 | 用途 |\n","|---|---|\n","| `index.faiss` | 文件向量與搜尋索引 |\n","| `documents.json` | 取回後提供給 LLM 的正文與來源資訊 |\n","| `index_doc_ids.json` | FAISS 編號對應的文件編號 |\n","| `config.json` | 模型確切版本、前綴、維度、正規化、套件版本及檢查資訊 |\n","\n","不保存模型權重、API 金鑰或其他環境變數。第二份 Colab 載入相同模型版本，只重新計算問題向量。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":30,"id":"068b87ce","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"068b87ce","outputId":"724bad6d-ec44-43eb-fbe1-5776130d0384","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795003007146,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":86,"user":{"displayName":"15黃渝晴","userId":"00994706994230549192"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["已保存：\n","config.json (1,376 bytes)\n","documents.json (22,488 bytes)\n","index.faiss (30,765 bytes)\n","index_doc_ids.json (132 bytes)\n","\n","模型版本及前綴已寫入 config.json。\n"]}],"source":["EXPORT_DIR = Path(tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"rag_index_\"))\n","faiss.write_index(index, str(EXPORT_DIR / \"index.faiss\"))\n","\n","for filename, data in [(\"documents.json\", documents), (\"index_doc_ids.json\", index_doc_ids)]:\n","    (EXPORT_DIR / filename).write_text(\n","        json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\"\n","    )\n","\n","config = {\n","    \"format_version\": \"1.0\",\n","    \"created_at\": datetime.now(ZoneInfo(\"Asia/Taipei\")).isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\"),\n","    \"model_id\": MODEL_ID,\n","    \"model_revision\": MODEL_REVISION,\n","    \"model_config_kwargs\": {\"vision_config\": None, \"audio_config\": None},\n","    \"dimension\": DIMENSION,\n","    \"normalize_embeddings\": True,\n","    \"index_type\": \"IndexFlatIP\",\n","    \"metric\": \"cosine_similarity_via_normalized_inner_product\",\n","    \"document_template\": DOCUMENT_TEMPLATE,\n","    \"query_template\": QUERY_TEMPLATE,\n","    \"encode_prompt\": \"\",\n","    \"max_seq_length\": TOKEN_LIMIT,\n","    \"document_count\": len(documents),\n","    \"document_unit\": \"one_document_one_vector\",\n","    \"document_text_includes_title\": True,\n","    \"package_versions\": PACKAGE_VERSIONS,\n","    \"build_device\": DEVICE,\n","    \"build_dtype\": str(DTYPE),\n","    \"source_archive\": archive_name,\n","    \"source_archive_sha256\": SOURCE_ARCHIVE_SHA256,\n","    \"file_sha256\": {\n","        name: hashlib.sha256((EXPORT_DIR / name).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\n","        for name in [\"index.faiss\", \"documents.json\", \"index_doc_ids.json\"]\n","    },\n","}\n","(EXPORT_DIR / \"config.json\").write_text(\n","    json.dumps(config, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\"\n",")\n","print(\"已保存：\")\n","for path in sorted(EXPORT_DIR.iterdir()):\n","    print(path.name, f\"({path.stat().st_size:,} bytes)\")\n","print(\"\\n模型版本及前綴已寫入 config.json。\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"c2f5e2c0","metadata":{"id":"c2f5e2c0"},"source":["## 15. 重新載入，驗證第二份 Colab 所需的資料\n","\n","從剛才保存的檔案重新載入，檢查完整性、文件編號與向量對應，再使用**同一個問題向量**比對保存前後的排名與分數。此處不重算問題向量，以免不同運算裝置的細微浮點誤差干擾索引保存檢查。\n","\n","也將 FAISS 結果與 NumPy 的全矩陣內積排序比較，確認精確搜尋的意義。遇到完全同分時，兩套工具的同分排列順序可以不同。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":31,"id":"ce699560","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"ce699560","outputId":"a5fd4e09-b02d-4c29-a7fd-e278812ef396","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795003010640,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":63,"user":{"displayName":"15黃渝晴","userId":"00994706994230549192"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["通過：檔案完整性、文件對照、索引維度、保存前後一致，以及精確搜尋檢查。\n"]}],"source":["loaded_config = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"config.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","for name, expected_hash in loaded_config[\"file_sha256\"].items():\n","    actual_hash = hashlib.sha256((EXPORT_DIR / name).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\n","    assert actual_hash == expected_hash, f\"檔案完整性檢查失敗：{name}\"\n","\n","loaded_index = faiss.read_index(str(EXPORT_DIR / \"index.faiss\"))\n","loaded_documents = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"documents.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","loaded_ids = json.loads((EXPORT_DIR / \"index_doc_ids.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n","assert loaded_index.ntotal == len(loaded_documents) == len(loaded_ids) == loaded_config[\"document_count\"]\n","assert loaded_index.d == loaded_config[\"dimension\"]\n","assert len(set(loaded_ids)) == len(loaded_ids)\n","assert set(loaded_ids) == {doc[\"doc_id\"] for doc in loaded_documents}\n","assert loaded_documents == documents and loaded_ids == index_doc_ids\n","\n","verification_query = embed_question(QUESTION)\n","k = min(TOP_K, index.ntotal)\n","before_scores, before_positions = index.search(verification_query, k)\n","after_scores, after_positions = loaded_index.search(verification_query, k)\n","np.testing.assert_array_equal(before_positions, after_positions)\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(before_scores, after_scores, atol=1e-6, rtol=1e-6)\n","\n","all_scores = (embeddings @ verification_query[0]).ravel()\n","expected_top_scores = np.sort(all_scores)[::-1][:k]\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(after_scores[0], expected_top_scores, atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-5)\n","np.testing.assert_allclose(after_scores[0], all_scores[after_positions[0]], atol=1e-5, rtol=1e-5)\n","print(\"通過：檔案完整性、文件對照、索引維度、保存前後一致，以及精確搜尋檢查。\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8f995fc4","metadata":{"id":"8f995fc4"},"source":["## 16. 打包並下載知識庫\n","\n","ZIP 根目錄包含前述四個檔案。下載後，留給第二份 Colab 上傳使用；模型權重不在 ZIP 裡。\n","\n","如果你更換文件、修改擷取函式或 embedding 設定，請重新執行受影響步驟並重新匯出，不要混用舊索引與新文件。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":32,"id":"ffccd7a9","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":53},"id":"ffccd7a9","outputId":"cc4a6d59-0b0a-4b20-86f0-79728e3df050","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795003013044,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":60,"user":{"displayName":"15黃渝晴","userId":"00994706994230549192"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["下載檔名： vector_db.zip\n","大小： 29,435 bytes\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Javascript object>"],"application/javascript":["\n","    async function download(id, filename, size) {\n","      if (!google.colab.kernel.accessAllowed) {\n","        return;\n","      }\n","      const div = document.createElement('div');\n","      const label = document.createElement('label');\n","      label.textContent = `Downloading \"${filename}\": `;\n","      div.appendChild(label);\n","      const progress = document.createElement('progress');\n","      progress.max = size;\n","      div.appendChild(progress);\n","      document.body.appendChild(div);\n","\n","      const buffers = [];\n","      let downloaded = 0;\n","\n","      const channel = await google.colab.kernel.comms.open(id);\n","      // Send a message to notify the kernel that we're ready.\n","      channel.send({})\n","\n","      for await (const message of channel.messages) {\n","        // Send a message to notify the kernel that we're ready.\n","        channel.send({})\n","        if (message.buffers) {\n","          for (const buffer of message.buffers) {\n","            buffers.push(buffer);\n","            downloaded += buffer.byteLength;\n","            progress.value = downloaded;\n","          }\n","        }\n","      }\n","      const blob = new Blob(buffers, {type: 'application/binary'});\n","      const a = document.createElement('a');\n","      a.href = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n","      a.download = filename;\n","      div.appendChild(a);\n","      a.click();\n","      div.remove();\n","    }\n","  "]},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Javascript object>"],"application/javascript":["download(\"download_e558ee1b-a69a-4bf8-b4e1-4fb24943e1d1\", \"vector_db.zip\", 29435)"]},"metadata":{}}],"source":["EXPORT_ZIP = EXPORT_DIR.parent / f\"{EXPORT_DIR.name}_download\" / EXPORT_ZIP_NAME\n","EXPORT_ZIP.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","required_files = [\"index.faiss\", \"documents.json\", \"index_doc_ids.json\", \"config.json\"]\n","with zipfile.ZipFile(EXPORT_ZIP, \"w\", compression=zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as archive:\n","    for name in required_files:\n","        archive.write(EXPORT_DIR / name, arcname=name)\n","with zipfile.ZipFile(EXPORT_ZIP) as archive:\n","    assert archive.testzip() is None\n","    assert set(archive.namelist()) == set(required_files)\n","print(\"下載檔名：\", EXPORT_ZIP_NAME)\n","print(\"大小：\", f\"{EXPORT_ZIP.stat().st_size:,} bytes\")\n","files.download(str(EXPORT_ZIP))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8229844c","metadata":{"id":"8229844c"},"source":["## 17. 換成自己的資料：修改清單與課堂練習\n","\n","1. 準備一篇一檔的 UTF-8 TXT，包成 ZIP；文件格式由你設計。\n","2. 修改 **`extract_rag_text()`**：哪些文字要搜尋，也要提供給 LLM？\n","3. 修改 **`extract_metadata()`**：哪些欄位用於來源、日期、分類或顯示？\n","4. 將 `EXPECTED_DOCUMENT_COUNT` 設為 `None` 或新資料的預期數量。\n","5. 先看一篇擷取結果，再批次整理。確認沒有把範例問題或答案集混入正文。\n","6. 從批次整理步驟重新建立向量及索引，並重新匯出。若新增 metadata 欄位，第二份 Colab 的顯示也要配合修改。\n","\n","**觀察問題：** 同一題改用 `top_k=1`、`3`、`5`，有哪些文章被取回？最高分文章能回答問題嗎？教材沒有答案時，為什麼搜尋仍有結果？\n","\n","本份只完成檢索，不會讓 LLM 產生答案。下一份才會讀取 Colab Secrets 名稱為 **`Groq`** 的密鑰，設定 `GROQ_API_KEY`，透過 AIsuite 呼叫 `groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b`，最後以 Gradio 展示。\n","\n","### 參考資料\n","\n","- [EmbeddingGemma 2 官方 Sentence Transformers 指引](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/embeddinggemma/inference-embeddinggemma-with-sentence-transformers)：文字模式、精度與檢索前綴。\n","- [EmbeddingGemma 2 模型](https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2)\n","- [FAISS 入門與索引說明](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/wiki/Getting-started)\n","\n","教材採用一篇一向量的設計。法規內容可能隨日期變動；來源網址可供追溯，這些摘要不能取代當時有效的法規與個案判斷。"]}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"https://github.com/yenlung/Generative-AI/blob/main/RAG_01_%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84_RAG_%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1.ipynb","timestamp":1794998516438}],"gpuType":"T4"},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12"},"widgets":{"application/vnd.jupyter.widget-state+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"state":{"c62e55648d2c40a289a122e06127687e":{"model_module":"@jupyter-widgets/controls","model_name":"HBoxModel","model_module_version":"1.5.0","state":{"_dom_classes":[],"_model_module":"@jupyter-widgets/controls","_model_module_version":"1.5.0","_model_name":"HBoxModel","_view_count":null,"_view_modu